            <characteristic name="Description" id="1818-cb1f-4015-5684" hidden="false" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per battle, when this model&apos;s unit is selected to fight, it can use this ability. If it does, until that fight is resolved, both Ka&apos;tah Stances are active for that unit, instead of only one.</characteristic>
