          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Shooting phase, after this model&apos;s unit has shot, if it is not within Engagement Range of any enemy units, it can make a Normal move of up to 6&quot;. If it does, until the end of the turn, this unit is not eligible to declare a charge.</characteristic>
