              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" id="f346-b5e4-eeb-895a" hidden="false" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time the bearer&apos;s unit ends a Charge move, select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of the bearer and roll one D6: on a 4+, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds. Once per battle, when the bearer&apos;s unit ends a Charge move, all enemy units within 6&quot; of the bearer must take a Battle-shock test.</characteristic>
