              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">ADEPTUS CUSTODES INFANTRY or ADEPTUS CUSTODES MOUNTED model only. In your Command phase, select one ADEPTUS CUSTODES VEHICLE or ADEPTUS CUSTODES MOUNTED unit within 6&quot; of the bearer. Until the start of your next Command phase, that unit is eligible to shoot in a turn in which it Fell Back.</characteristic>
